        "info": "## Energy Consumers Dashboard\\n\\n**Flow 840** — Tuya + Tasmota energy meters on Energy page after Huawei.\\n\\nRegenerate: `node nodered/live-connection/scripts/generate-flow-840.mjs`\\n\\nSee docs/ENERGY_CONSUMER_ADD.md",
